  "prefLabel": "Ins 2402.02 Applicability and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2402.02 Applicability and Scope. This part shall apply to every property and casualty insurance company doing business in this state, unless otherwise exempted by the domiciliary commissioner.\n\nSource. #9892, eff 4-1-11; ss by #12705, eff 4-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins2400.html"
